# Files in this package that stow must NOT symlink into $HOME.
# settings.json, auth.json and mcp-adapter.json are tracked snapshots, not
# stowed: pig rewrites settings.json at runtime (changelog version, deviceId),
# and mcp-adapter.json differs from pi's live file (playwright profile points
# at pig's own data dir). The live files at ~/.config/pig/agent are the source
# of truth. Refresh the snapshots with:
#   cp ~/.config/pig/agent/settings.json pig/.config/pig/agent/settings.json
#   cp ~/.config/pig/agent/mcp-adapter.json pig/.config/pig/agent/mcp-adapter.json
settings.json
auth.json
mcp-adapter.json
\.stow-local-ignore
